sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Timer local
    participant APP as App C#
    participant DB as Cache local
    participant G as Gmail API

    T->>APP: Dispara atualização
    APP->>DB: Lê lastHistoryId
    APP->>G: history.list(startHistoryId)
    G->>APP: Retorna mudanças
    APP->>G: messages.get(IDs alterados)
    G->>APP: Retorna detalhes
    APP->>DB: Atualiza cache local
    APP->>APP: Atualiza UI
